  "ingredients": [
    "1/4 cup coconut oil",
    "1/4 cup low-carb maple syrup",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract",
    "7 drop liquid stevia",
    "2 cup almond flour",
    "1/4 teaspoon baking soda",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "1/3 cup macadamia nuts (optional)",
    "2 tablespoon ground cinnamon",
    "2 tablespoon erythritol"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. In a bowl, add the coconut oil, maple syrup, vanilla, and liquid stevia.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2080.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, combine the almond flour, baking soda, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2082.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Optional: If using macadamia nuts, add them to a food processor and pulse until coarsely ground.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2083.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the wet ingredients until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2089.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and combine well to form a dough mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2104.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Optional: If using macadamia nuts, add them in here.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2111.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Create the topping by combining the cinnamon and erythritol in a small metal bowl or ramekin.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2101.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll the dough into balls, dip them in the cinnamon mixture, and place on a Silpat. Use the bottom side of a mason jar (greased if needed) to flatten the balls — this gives them that classic \"cracked\" snickerdoodle look.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2114.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat for all of the cookies. Make sure they are relatively spread out, but they will not spread too much.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2116.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 9–10 minutes. They will look undercooked at first, but they'll firm up once out of the oven.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2123.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool and serve!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50889-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/IMG_2132.jpg"
    }
  ],
